{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24195","headline":"玉泉寺南三里涧下多深红踯躅繁艳殊常感惜题诗以示游者 · 白居易","name":"玉泉寺南三里涧下多深红踯躅繁艳殊常感惜题诗以示游者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉泉南涧花奇怪，不似花丛似火堆。\n今日多情唯我到，每年无故爲谁开。\n宁辞辛苦行三里，更与留连饮两杯。\n犹有一般辜负事，不将歌舞管弦来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}